    "stylesGuide": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "page": "styles",
      "text": "Same facts on every board, so you compare style only.\n\nA Console — dense SOC tool, dark, IBM Plex.\nB Minimal — no cards, one sentence answers the 3 questions, Geist.\nC Editorial — report for management, serif headline, Newsreader.\nD Terminal — keyboard-first, all mono, phosphor accent.\nE Soft — rounded cards, icons, friendly SaaS, Plus Jakarta Sans.\n\nEach board has its own Tweaks (theme, accent, radius / ink / phosphor, density). Tell me the winner — or mix, e.g. B's layout with A's badges.",
